  ('recap-ufc-fight-night-moicano-vs-nolan', 'recap', '2026-10-31', '{"iso":"2026-10-31","name":"UFC Fight Night : Moicano vs. Nolan","location":"Meta Apex, Las Vegas","results":[{"fight":"Tom Nolan def. Renato Moicano","method":"TKO","note":{"fr":"Main event · R3, 1:28","en":"Main event · R3, 1:28","es":"Main event · R3, 1:28"}},{"fight":"Jacobe Smith def. Randy Brown","method":"Décision unanime","note":"Co-main event"},{"fight":"Cody Durden def. Ode Osbourne","method":"Décision unanime","note":"29-28 x3"},{"fight":"Luana Santos def. Yana Santos","method":"Décision unanime","note":"29-28 x3"},{"fight":"Jean-Paul Lebosnoyani def. Farman Hasanov","method":"TKO","note":{"fr":"Arrêt médical (coupure) · R3, 2:11","en":"Doctor stoppage (cut) · R3, 2:11","es":"Detención médica (corte) · R3, 2:11"}}],"note":{"fr":"Dominé au sol pendant un round et demi, Nolan profite d''une remise debout contestée de l''arbitre pour finir Moicano aux coudes au 3e round. Jacobe Smith reste invaincu (14-0) et Julian Erosa signe un KO pour son dernier combat.","en":"Controlled on the ground for a round and a half, Nolan made the most of a disputed referee stand-up to finish Moicano with elbows in round 3. Jacobe Smith stays unbeaten (14-0) and Julian Erosa scored a knockout in his final fight.","es":"Dominado en el suelo durante asalto y medio, Nolan aprovechó una polémica orden del árbitro de levantarse para terminar a Moicano con codazos en el tercer asalto. Jacobe Smith sigue invicto (14-0) y Julian Erosa firmó un KO en su último combate."}}'::jsonb),
